361	// Coach reserves a slot for an off-platform student. Mirrors the
362	// /owner/bookings/manual pattern: totalPrice=0, status=confirmed, bookerUserId
363	// null, coachId set to the caller. We require the chosen court to be one the
364	// coach is approved at (courtCoachesTable) so a coach can't park bookings on
365	// arbitrary courts. Overlapping existing bookings/blocks return 409.
